   "source": [
    "# Model Comparison V3 - Stock-Aware Sentiment + Binary vs 3-class + isPresident\n",
    "\n",
    "Nieuwe features tov V2:\n",
    "- **LLM-based tweet -> stock impact scoring** (sentence-transformer met TF-IDF fallback)\n",
    "- **Stock-aware sentiment aggregatie** ipv market-wide\n",
    "- **isPresident feature**: 1 als datum tijdens Trump's ambtstermijn valt\n",
    "- **Binary vs 3-class vergelijking** voor alle modellen\n",
    "- **trained_models tracking** voor save-best-per-stocktype aan het eind"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a971bf1a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Setup"
   ]
  },
  {
